# Terraform Level 3 Capstone: Enterprise AWS IAM Governance, KMS Encryption & Multi-Workspace Provisioning

Production-grade Infrastructure-as-Code (IaC) capstone implementing automated IAM naming sanitization and tagging governance, AWS KMS symmetric encryption/decryption workflows, and multi-workspace API Gateway and CloudWatch Log Group provisioning using Terraform.

